182: [Heading2] 3.2 Model development and internal performance
183: Candidate algorithms will be compared by cross-validated AUROC/AUPRC and calibration; the primary model will be selected a priori by pre-specified criteria. Internal discrimination is expected in the AUROC ? [0.80?0.88] range based on prior survey-based models. Reported: internal AUROC [ ], AUPRC [ ], calibration slope [ ], Brier [ ].
184: [Heading2] 3.3 Geographic and temporal (COVID) external validation
